  <div class="topbar-container">
    <!-- content -->
  </div>
</div>
```

**Navbar HTML structure** (needs refactoring):
```html
<nav id="navbar">
  <div class="nav-container">
    <!-- logo, nav-links, nav-actions, mobile-toggle -->
  </div>
</nav>
```

**Hero HTML structure** (needs refactoring):
```html
<section id="hero">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-badge">...</div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">...</h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">...</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">...</div>
  </div>
</section>
```

**Sections already using content-grid** (correct pattern):
```html
<section id="services" class="content-grid">
  <div class="sc-header breakout">...</div>
  <div class="sc-tabs breakout">...</div>
  <div class="sc-panel breakout">...</div>
</section>
```

